  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Each character will have two spells (a basic attack and a special ability)
    identified by their color. You can only use one spell from each per round.\n\nStarting
    at level 2, there will be character combinations where 2 of them will join forces
    to cast a more powerful spell at the cost of using their actions. \nSpells used
    will not be recovered after the round. Choose wisely what to play."
